Both $P$ and $Q$ have coordinate sum $a^2$, so: $$M = h(A,2)(P) = (-a^2 : 2(a^2 - c^2) : 2c^2),$$ $$N = h(A,2)(Q) = (-a^2 : 2b^2 : 2(a^2 - b^2)).$$

